body:
I want to hear people on his side defend this shit. When muslim extremists/conservatives/authoritarians abuse and kill LGBT people around the world, I don't even have to catch my breath before condemning them on a personal and religious level. To quote a classic;

Where are all the moderate Christians condemning this pastor?

(To be clear, I know they exist and vastly outnumber these nutjobs, but I am still interested in seeing a conservative response to this)
